# Working directory for the Hermes Agent's session state (~/.hermes/ at runtime;
# also created in-repo when an agent operates in this checkout). Plans, audit
# logs, and per-session caches are never artifacts of the codebase.
.hermes/

# Tool Search live-test harness output — non-deterministic model transcripts,
# regenerated by scripts/tool_search_livetest.py. Never an artifact of the repo.
scripts/out/

# Per-release changelog drafts. These exist only transiently during a release
# cut (passed to `gh release create --notes-file`); the GitHub Release itself
# stores the published notes. They are not a build artifact and must never be
# committed to the repo root. See the hermes-release skill.
RELEASE_v*.md

# Secrets staging (never committed) — pipeline live-test creds, OneCLI vault in prod
temp/
secrets/
*.env

# Private 24KR label-ops instance design (us-only)
aurum_24kr_labelops_design.md

# Private instance layer (24KR label-ops) — never in public Aurum
instance/

# Runtime state + build artifacts — never versioned. Organ SQLite DBs are mutable per-run
# state (a committed el.db dirties the repo on every test run and leaks ledger state); zips
# are build artifacts. (Several were swept in by an earlier `git add -A -- aurum/`; untracked
# here and ignored so it cannot recur.)
*.db
*.zip

# Serena MCP local project/tooling state (per-developer; not a repo artifact).
.serena/

# Local design / working docs — us-only, never committed (the spec/strategy/reference layer).
